    ph:sourcePage 71 ;
    ph:sourceText "[p. 71] China has approved both monovalent and bivalent inactivated vaccines that target the Hantaan and Seoul viruses. These are included in national immunisation programmes in endemic areas and have contributed to a marked decrease in HFRS cases."@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom ph:HERA_Virus_Prioritisation_Report ;
    idmp:hasIndicationAsDiseaseSymptomProcedure ph:Haemorrhagic_Fever_With_Renal_Syndrome ;
    idmp:isApplicableIn ph:China .

