    ph:sourcePage 71 ;
    ph:sourceText "[p. 71] There is no approved vaccine in the US but several candidates do exist there. These include DNA-based vaccines and viral-vector platforms that target the Sin Nombre and Andes viruses. They have reached early-phase clinical trials, largely driven by federal research initiatives with dual public health and biodefence goals."@en ;
