    ph:sourcePage 68 ;
    ph:sourceText "[p. 68] Vaccines for RVF (including the live-attenuated Smithburn vaccine and various inactivated formulations) are currently available for veterinary use but are not widely distributed on a global scale. No human vaccines have received regulatory approval to date, but significant efforts are underway to advance human vaccine candidates, and several of these are in the late preclinical or early clinical development stages."@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom ph:HERA_Virus_Prioritisation_Report ;
    idmp:hasIndicationAsDiseaseSymptomProcedure ph:RiftValleyFever ;
    idmp:isApplicableIn ph:Global .

