    ph:sourcePage 30 ;
    ph:sourceText "[p. 30] Comirnaty (Pfizer-BioNTech) and Spikevax (Moderna) deliver lipid-nanoparticles-encapsulated mRNA that encodes the SARS-CoV-2 spike protein. Both have variant-adapted formulations authorised for Omicron BA.1, BA.4-5, XBB.1.5 and, most recently, the JN.1 and KP.2 subvariants."@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom ph:HERA_Virus_Prioritisation_Report ;
    idmp:hasIndicationAsDiseaseSymptomProcedure ph:COVID_19 ;
    idmp:isApplicableIn cmns-ge-euj:EuropeanUnion .

